1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,810
(Sheldon:)The white zone
is for loading and unloading.

2
00:00:02,983 --> 00:00:05,243
(Sheldon:)We're breaking the law.

3
00:00:05,418 --> 00:00:09,118
(Penny:)- There's no space in the white zone, so...
- Anyway...

4
00:00:09,723 --> 00:00:12,593
(Leonard:)...we can e-mail and I think
the phone connections are good.

5
00:00:12,759 --> 00:00:15,519
You have to get out of the car now.
I'm not going to jail.

6
00:00:15,729 --> 00:00:18,489
- Would you just relax?
- Oh, I see a space in the white zone.

7
00:00:18,665 --> 00:00:20,995
(Sheldon:)Quick, circle the airport.

8
00:00:22,002 --> 00:00:24,032
- Did you bring enough inhalers?
- Yeah.

9
00:00:24,237 --> 00:00:28,467
And extra Dramamine? You remember
what happened on It's a Small World.

10
00:00:29,442 --> 00:00:31,032
- I'm covered.
- Okay.

11
00:00:31,244 --> 00:00:33,944
(Sheldon:)Dear Lord, a police officer
is glancing in our direction.

12
00:00:34,114 --> 00:00:35,844
(Sheldon:)We've been made.

13
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:39,780
(Leonard:)Calm down, I'm getting out.

14
00:00:40,253 --> 00:00:42,883
(Leonard:)- I have something I want to give you.
- Oh, Leonard.

15
00:00:43,056 --> 00:00:44,956
It's a locket with Leonard's face in it.

16
00:00:45,125 --> 00:00:47,555
(Sheldon:)He got it at the mall on clearance.
Move, move, move!

17
00:00:50,063 --> 00:00:51,253
(Penny:)I love you.

18
00:00:52,365 --> 00:00:54,265
(Leonard:)I love you too.

19
00:00:56,770 --> 00:01:09,030
(Sheldon:)Don't worry, officer, they just love
each other, we're not smuggling drugs.

